id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
41456::$$$message_0300_0000_0000$$$::"Saber, Sweet Potato (Left),[br]::
41457::$$$message_0300_0000_0001$$$::Date Outfit (Center Left), and[br]::
41458::$$$message_0300_0000_0002$$$::Swimsuit (Center Right, Right). They're exactly as you see them."::
41459::$$$message_0300_0001_0000$$$::"'We made the swimsuit a two-piece to surprise you,' they said."::
41460::$$$message_0300_0002_0000$$$::"Her date outfit seems to have stuck quite faithfully to Tsukurimonoji's design... [cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01d(中)b][wvl canskip=0 time=600][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01d(中)b]Why is your face red, Rin?"::
41461::$$$message_0300_0003_0000$$$::"W-well, um...[br]While you could say her swimsuit already breaks the rules..."::
41462::$$$message_0300_0004_0000$$$::"Do you see how evil this sweet potato-eating Saber is!?[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01f頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01f頬(中)][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=3] Get it!?[wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=3] Yeah, you get me![wvl canskip=0 time=400] Now I understand why Emiya [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=5]can't stop feeding her!"::
41463::$$$message_0300_0005_0000$$$::"Let's not overfeed her, though.[br]There are only so many calories on the planet."::

